{"steam_appid":3548580,"steam_name":"Chill with You : Lo-Fi Story","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3548580/1084159984/c94e7eb230b6ee1fb1535f6ee115d3a39024c39b/1750860407/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762775091","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257153324/47eade7dd9f5d0c4fd9a0297866d7862b36a6a55/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762775091","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/ce09905c917b68561ed8ee8eff426e476e1b25bd/ss_ce09905c917b68561ed8ee8eff426e476e1b25bd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785091736","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/3a0d564232b71d6060d36b792d29b62999bf65fe/ss_3a0d564232b71d6060d36b792d29b62999bf65fe.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785091736","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/231825667934abf9a55f387352a4f55f0859bd99/ss_231825667934abf9a55f387352a4f55f0859bd99.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785091736","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/7dfa46cfdaace4ade5eea94b19eeded6f823c8b8/ss_7dfa46cfdaace4ade5eea94b19eeded6f823c8b8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785091736","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/68103ae2a17ddfcc8c8db808e04c3af329b1f73c/ss_68103ae2a17ddfcc8c8db808e04c3af329b1f73c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785091736"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill with You : Lo-Fi Story is a work-focused sound novel game where you work at your desk alongside Satone, an imaginative girl who loves writing novels. Customize the Lofi music, ambient sounds, and scenery that reflect Satone’s emotions to enhance your focus! The more time you spend working together, the deeper your bond will grow—perhaps you’ll even connect with Satone on a deeper level…?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/3d19549ab2399a7507fb63d8718ea3d4.poster.avif?t=1785091736\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/3d19549ab2399a7507fb63d8718ea3d4.webm?t=1785091736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/3d19549ab2399a7507fb63d8718ea3d4.mp4?t=1785091736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEWS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've added macOS support — thanks to your many requests! (May 13, 2025)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Emotionally Expressive Music to Maximize Focus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to relax and work at a leisurely pace or boost your motivation with emotionally engaging melodies, <i>Chill Talk</i> offers a variety of original songs tailored for different work scenarios.<br>Immerse yourself in deep focus while listening to high-quality music from talented sound artists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/8867198ed92a34de64e3bb1336fef3ef.avif?t=1785091736\" width=640 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Wide Variety of Nature Sounds to Awaken Your Instincts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, it’s best to turn off the music and listen to the soothing sounds of nature. Let the sound of wind, rain, and other natural elements sharpen your senses and create a deeply immersive work environment.<br>Customize the ambient sounds to suit your preferences.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/25213b39881660dc5655583d994db6c2.poster.avif?t=1785091736\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/25213b39881660dc5655583d994db6c2.webm?t=1785091736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pomodoro Timer for Maximum Productivity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up a Pomodoro timer before you start working to manage your break times effectively. Taking short, regular breaks helps maintain maximum concentration and efficiency.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/f0d32b2b8f2bfdbb85907a22269b1971.poster.avif?t=1785091736\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/f0d32b2b8f2bfdbb85907a22269b1971.webm?t=1785091736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/f0d32b2b8f2bfdbb85907a22269b1971.mp4?t=1785091736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Satone’s Hidden Feelings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your break, take time to interact with Satone. The “precious moments” you share while working together will deepen your relationship, and if you build enough trust, she may eventually open her heart to you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/cd12e50df0a94137413e6cb1d48aa169.poster.avif?t=1785091736\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/cd12e50df0a94137413e6cb1d48aa169.webm?t=1785091736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548580/extras/cd12e50df0a94137413e6cb1d48aa169.mp4?t=1785091736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie"],"developers":["Nestopi Inc."],"publishers":["Nestopi Inc."],"release_date":"16 Nov, 2025"}